# Ignore everything in the root by default
/*
!.gitignore
!models.py

# Unignore these shared models (code/config only, not binaries)
!model_general_v3/

# Within unignored directories, ignore binary artifacts and test results
*/output*
*/tests/results*
model_general_v3/*.pb
model_general_v3/variables/

# --- Small text artifacts of every trained model -------------------------
# An experiment's worktree is disposable and its models/ is gitignored, so
# pruning used to destroy the only copy of its per-fold numbers — which is
# exactly what a later paired comparison needs (LOOP.md "Compare paired, per
# fold"). standardize-blocks' 0.261 was lost that way. Keep the two small text
# artifacts on the branch: ~4 KB per model, and they make every past experiment
# comparable forever. Weights, predictions.csv and plots stay ignored.
#
# Git will not descend into an excluded directory, so each level has to be
# re-included before the files inside it can be.
!*/
*/*
!*/folds_sx.csv
!*/folds/
*/folds/**
!*/folds/**/
!*/folds/**/summary.json
